<title>POLAND: POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT FALLS TO 13.5 PCT IN SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT FALLS TO 13.5 PCT IN SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland</p>
<p>fell to 13.5 percent of the workforce in September from 13.8</p>
<p>percent in August, figures from the Central Statistical Office</p>
<p>(GUS) show.</p>
<p> POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT	SEPTEMBER    AUGUST     SEPT 1995</p>
<p> number of jobless mln	2.341	2.401	  2.657</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    13.5	 13.8	   15.0</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
